      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "A primary argument is that widespread automation will lead to mass structural unemployment, rendering traditional labor markets obsolete. UBI provides a necessary economic floor, ensuring that everyone has basic needs met even without a traditional job, thus preventing societal collapse. Furthermore, it allows humans to pursue education, caregiving, or entrepreneurial ventures that AI cannot easily replace, fostering a more resilient and diversified society. This safety net is crucial for managing the transition to an AI-driven economy.",
